# ai-apps inventory, profile: example — the format `capture` writes to <config>/ai-apps/profiles/<profile>.inv
# format: app|kind|name[|key]  (names only — no secrets)
# The real <profile>.inv files live in <config>/ai-apps/profiles/ ($SYSTEM_TOOLS_CONFIG, default ~/.config/system).
claude-code|mcp|context7
claude-code|plugin|claude-hud@claude-hud
claude-code|skill|find-skills
codex|mcp|context7
opencode|mcp|github
